---
import ResourcePageLayout from "../../../layouts/ResourcePageLayout.astro";
---

<ResourcePageLayout
  title="eCash"
  description="An introduction to eCash — digital cash built on Bitcoin and Lightning."
  lang="en"
>
  <section class="nav-buttons">
    <a href="/en/learn/lightning" class="nav-btn">The Lightning Network</a>
    <a href="/en/learn/liquid" class="nav-btn">Liquid</a>
    <a href="/en/learn/bitcoin-blockchain" class="nav-btn">The Bitcoin Blockchain</a>
  </section>

  <section class="intro">
    <p>
      eCash is digital cash built on top of Bitcoin. With the Cashu protocol, you can send and receive bitcoin instantly, almost for free, and with full privacy — just like physical cash, but in digital form. Tokens live on your device, and no one can trace your transactions.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="category-section">
    <h2>eCash Wallets</h2>
    <p class="section-desc">Choose a wallet to get started with eCash.</p>
    <div class="links-grid">
      <a href="https://www.enuts.cash/" class="link-card" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        <span class="link-card-title">eNuts</span>
        <span class="link-card-note">iOS & Android</span>
        <span class="link-card-arrow">→</span>
      </a>
      <a href="https://wallet.cashu.me/" class="link-card" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        <span class="link-card-title">Cashu.me</span>
        <span class="link-card-note">Web (PWA)</span>
        <span class="link-card-arrow">→</span>
      </a>
      <a href="https://nutstash.app/" class="link-card" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        <span class="link-card-title">Nutstash</span>
        <span class="link-card-note">Web (PWA)</span>
        <span class="link-card-arrow">→</span>
      </a>
      <a href="https://www.minibits.cash/" class="link-card" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        <span class="link-card-title">Minibits</span>
        <span class="link-card-note">Android</span>
        <span class="link-card-arrow">→</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="category-section">
    <h2>Mints & tools</h2>
    <p class="section-desc">Find a mint to connect your wallet to. You can use several mints to spread the risk.</p>
    <div class="links-grid">
      <a href="https://cashumints.space/" class="link-card" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        <span class="link-card-title">CashuMints.space</span>
        <span class="link-card-note">Mint overview</span>
        <span class="link-card-arrow">→</span>
      </a>
      <a href="https://bitcoinmints.com/?tab=mints" class="link-card" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        <span class="link-card-title">Bitcoinmints.com</span>
        <span class="link-card-note">Mint overview</span>
        <span class="link-card-arrow">→</span>
      </a>
      <a href="https://proxnut.com/" class="link-card" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        <span class="link-card-title">Proxnut</span>
        <span class="link-card-note">Proxy for mints</span>
        <span class="link-card-arrow">→</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="content-section">
    <h2>How does eCash work?</h2>
    <div class="steps">
      <div class="step">
        <span class="step-number">1</span>
        <div class="step-text">
          <strong>Deposit bitcoin</strong> – You send bitcoin (typically via Lightning) to a mint.
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <span class="step-number">2</span>
        <div class="step-text">
          <strong>Receive eCash tokens</strong> – The mint issues tokens using "blind signatures". This means the mint can't see who owns which tokens.
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <span class="step-number">3</span>
        <div class="step-text">
          <strong>Use your tokens</strong> – Send them to others, pay for services, or redeem them back to bitcoin. Transactions are instant and almost free.
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="content-section">
    <h2>Benefits and limitations</h2>
    <div class="pros-cons">
      <div class="pros">
        <h3>Benefits</h3>
        <p><strong>Privacy</strong> – The mint can't see your balance, your transactions, or who you trade with.</p>
        <p><strong>Speed</strong> – Transactions are instant, since they don't require confirmation on the blockchain.</p>
        <p><strong>Low fees</strong> – Almost free to send and receive.</p>
        <p><strong>Easy onboarding</strong> – Perfect for small amounts, tips, and micropayments.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="cons">
        <h3>Limitations</h3>
        <p><strong>Trust in the mint</strong> – Your bitcoin is held by the mint. Use several mints to spread the risk.</p>
        <p><strong>Not for large amounts</strong> – Designed for everyday transactions, not long-term storage.</p>
        <p><strong>Device-dependent</strong> – Tokens live on your device, but Cashu has a recovery feature with a seed phrase.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="category-section">
    <h2>Learn more</h2>
    <div class="links-grid">
      <a href="https://cashu.space/" class="link-card" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        <span class="link-card-title">Cashu.space</span>
        <span class="link-card-note">Official website</span>
        <span class="link-card-arrow">→</span>
      </a>
      <a href="https://docs.cashu.space/projects" class="link-card" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        <span class="link-card-title">Cashu Docs</span>
        <span class="link-card-note">Projects & documentation</span>
        <span class="link-card-arrow">→</span>
      </a>
      <a href="https://bitcoin.design/guide/how-it-works/ecash/cashu/" class="link-card" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        <span class="link-card-title">Bitcoin Design Guide</span>
        <span class="link-card-note">Visual introduction</span>
        <span class="link-card-arrow">→</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <a href="#" class="back-to-top"> ↑ Back to top </a>
</ResourcePageLayout>

<style>
  /* Navigation buttons */
  .nav-buttons {
    display: flex;
    gap: var(--space-md, 1rem);
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .nav-btn {
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 150px;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
    background-color: var(--primary);
    color: #000;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    border-radius: 6px;
    border: 1px solid var(--primary);
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
  }

  .nav-btn:hover {
    background-color: transparent;
    color: var(--primary);
  }

  /* Intro */
  .intro {
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--text-light, #ccc);
  }

  .intro p {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  /* Content sections */
  .content-section {
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--text-light, #ccc);
  }

  .content-section h2 {
    color: var(--primary);
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md, 1rem);
    padding-bottom: var(--space-sm, 0.5rem);
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(247, 147, 26, 0.2);
  }

  /* Steps */
  .steps {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  .step {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 1rem;
    padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
    border: 1px solid rgba(247, 147, 26, 0.1);
    border-radius: 10px;
  }

  .step-number {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 32px;
    height: 32px;
    min-width: 32px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--primary);
    color: #000;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  .step-text {
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  /* Pros and cons */
  .pros-cons {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  .pros, .cons {
    padding: 1.25rem;
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
    border: 1px solid rgba(247, 147, 26, 0.1);
  }

  .pros h3, .cons h3 {
    color: var(--primary);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .pros p, .cons p {
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .pros p:last-child, .cons p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  /* Category sections */
  .category-section {
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .category-section h2 {
    color: var(--primary);
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-sm, 0.5rem);
    padding-bottom: var(--space-sm, 0.5rem);
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(247, 147, 26, 0.2);
  }

  .section-desc {
    color: var(--text-light, #ccc);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    opacity: 0.8;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md, 1rem);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  /* Links grid */
  .links-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(220px, 1fr));
    gap: var(--space-md, 1rem);
  }

  .link-card {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
    border-radius: 12px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
    border: 1px solid rgba(247, 147, 26, 0.15);
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
  }

  .link-card:hover {
    background: rgba(247, 147, 26, 0.08);
    border-color: var(--primary);
    transform: translateY(-3px);
  }

  .link-card-title {
    color: var(--text-light, #ccc);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .link-card-note {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    opacity: 0.5;
    margin-left: auto;
  }

  .link-card-arrow {
    color: var(--primary);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 567px) {
    .nav-buttons {
      flex-direction: column;
    }

    .links-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }

    .pros-cons {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
